  "details": "An odd one: if you create a single flow path, like an Update -> Branch, and then create a disconnected object that you get a property from, like Transform -> set localPosition - the noodle origin will get stuck if you move the graph around (see attached gif)\nThis doesnt seem to happen if you just grab an object and try to add a node that is connected to it.\nThis does happen for any object, be it a player defined variable or smth like Networking.LocalPlayer\n\nThis is actual for both Live (sdk 2021.03.22.18.27) and current Open Beta (sdk 2021.04.16.12.12)",
